[I] Library for managing secrets

[T] libsecret is a library for storing and retrieving passwords and other
[T] secrets. It communicates with the "Secret Service" using D-Bus.

[U] https://www.gnome.org

[A] The GNOME Project <gnome-devel-list@gnome.org>
[M] Juergen "George" Sawinski <jsaw@gmx.net>
[M] Susanne Klaus <vadja@gmx.de>

[C] extra/shell extra/desktop/gnome
[F] CROSS

[L] LGPL
[V] 0.21.8
[P] X -----5---9 179.200

[CV-URL] https://download.gnome.org/sources/libsecret/cache.json
[D] d1e15ae8ff76896bd2d68d68d1e52bc49b504ef4168be864b0bc5e68 libsecret-0.21.8.tar.xz https://download.gnome.org/sources/libsecret/0.21/

. $base/package/*/*/gnome-conf.in

pkginstalled gi-docgen || var_append mesonopt ' ' -Dgtk_doc=false
pkginstalled libxslt docbook-xml docbook-xsl || var_append mesonopt ' ' -Dmanpage=false
pkginstalled gobject-introspection || var_append mesonopt ' ' -Dintrospection=false
pkginstalled vala || var_append mesonopt ' ' -Dvapi=false
